{"date":"19 March 2021","imageSource":"https://res.cloudinary.com/studio-bagno/image/upload/v1628486402/sb/files/upload_a31b67bdd99e6479e17dd923c46c8309.png","source":"https://studiobagno.com.au/blog/salo-house-by-thursday-architects-featuring-matte-white-studio-bagno-bathroom-design","summary":"SALO House is simply a breath taking example of contemporary Australian design. We take you on an exclusive tour of Salo's bathrooms, which feature a very special collection of Studio Bagno bathware in Matte White.","title":"Salo By Thursday Architects","id":"salo-house-by-thursday-architects-featuring-matte-white-studio-bagno-bathroom-design","bodyHtml":"<div><div>\n<p><img alt=\"Salo House by Thursday Architects featuring Matte White Studio Bagno bathroom products\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"797\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/source-117aea46d3c4045676c4.webp\" width=\"1400\"/></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>\"Bold Forms, Strong Lines\"</h3>\n<hr/>\n<h4>Salo House is a breathtaking example of the best of contemporary Australian design. A stunning family home designed by <a href=\"https://thursdayarchitecture.com.au/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Thursday Architects</strong></a> and built by <a href=\"https://www.d3projects.com.au\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>D3 Projects</strong></a>, soft tones and textures are masterfully blended and complimented by exquisite detail.<br/>\n<br/>\nThis month's project spotlight takes you on an exclusive tour of Salo's bathrooms, which all feature a our Studio Bagno bathware in a soft and tactile matte white glaze.</h4>\n<p><img alt=\"bathroom design matte white - Studio bagno\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1714\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/source-7859727104ec3febe154.webp\" width=\"1350\"/></p>\n<h4>A sublime blend of natural stone and terrazzo coupled with outstanding architecture and obsessive detailing. The whole, offset by the subtlety of our matte white glaze adding a softer textured white to the basins, baths and toilets.</h4>\n<p><img alt=\"bathroom design above counter basins\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"959\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/source-0f0511fdfd24b1279e95.webp\" width=\"1400\"/></p>\n<h3>\"Bold forms and strong lines are complimented with luxurious finishes in the main ensuite at SALO\"</h3>\n<p><img alt=\"bathroom design above counter basins\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1777\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/source-add1fc9b54336acf9862.webp\" width=\"1400\"/></p>\n<p><img alt=\"bathroom design above counter basins\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1777\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/source-e01c49537f06a4efecd1.webp\" width=\"1400\"/></p>\n<p><img alt=\"bathroom design above counter basins\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1777\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/source-45b628ecb4ae1f71cda1.webp\" width=\"1400\"/></p>\n<p><img alt=\"bathroom design above counter basins\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1777\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/source-fe654d2bfdaff5103629.webp\" width=\"1400\"/></p>\n<p><img alt=\"bathroom design above counter basins\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1777\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/source-736ea8da8a0781617ece.webp\" width=\"1400\"/></p>\n<h4>Architecture: <a href=\"https://thursdayarchitecture.com.au/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Thursday Architects</strong></a><br/>\nConstruction: <a href=\"https://www.d3projects.com.au\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>D3 Projects</strong></a><br/>\nPhotography by: <a href=\"https://www.annestroud.com.au/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Anne Stroud Photography</strong></a></h4>\n \n\n\n<h4>Thanks for reading!</h4>\n \n\n\n<div>\n<h3>Explore Studio Bagno Products Featured in Salo House below</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<hr/></div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><p class=\"source-photo-unavailable\">This source photograph could not be copied into the draft. <a href=\"https://studiobagno.com.au/blog/salo-house-by-thursday-architects-featuring-matte-white-studio-bagno-bathroom-d